      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许，\n它甚至能做到从这个世界上\n消除“孤身一人”这件事――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f780c878485570cc4976f0b39cd2914b45ca7e329cfe9548de760f284a9029c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
