    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3a03e67a0d0690f92c3221a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "闪耀系列赛――\n我要倾尽全力地奔跑下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbf93a4bbb4f37a06c0778b649bfa2ce7c39d9c50720785321b0d0e8a1423374",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        82,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/82/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35755b2a3705743badb54155",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这颗无时无刻为他者着想的澄澈心灵。\n这份超乎寻常的纯洁，甚至令人联想到天使。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcb1936697a8a8e176a953bef1c9dc7b70d88b7413cac42641108df4ffbcc52b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        83,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/83/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7daa370ede9d36341b12bcac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……还有，这一切又究竟会带给她什么）",
      "source_fingerprint": "89a7323caf7fba48b93f232fccb7072e9c63442c2e0bed9b6556fdec29cdf3cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        84,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/84/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f1a2c92bc6c737f3975cf26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她脚下的道路，究竟会通向什么――\n她的终点，究竟会是什么――",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fde8a984647a2b0d8021b4a0a7446f8f5132844e0fb7298e7ca7e06c92b1e6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        84,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/84/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65f66c4415d600aa57a9bdec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb50d57d7703a64ba6e9d70094d69e3edf1f53654ce1b6055f0ddd7c2b63d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        85,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/85/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e581cb1039ed9051aecbcbcb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……让我们一起，联结下去吧。\n一步一步、一点一点地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a506e6011b039f84cc03329f6400c7a2a324bb11009e7dc9be875d8d4cde8030",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        85,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/85/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbdbd83b0285b3c0f7d026bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“或许什么也带不来”――\n即便如此，她的脚步也不会停止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aacdbe6e07a21f69818f293366236667a66b3d0d63bc9f141c40a25f0e7920ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        86,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/86/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffc1550d3ba98ab16af983cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我坚信，能看到希望的天空",
      "source_fingerprint": "278f3bb6e003d6b437c11ff3add01bd1d2a77048d1991c79369a64d58dffda2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        87,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/87/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:652082a5e3ea631581d1ee9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么就让我在一旁守护她、支持她吧\n直至遥远的彼方――她抵达终点的那一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80abc6129fcf173efd6b5838937232a6ca6a9a52ac9b155c7334fd9dcf9e989",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        87,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/87/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ff81e08266531be3fce39e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，我和比萨胜驹\n一同挑战闪耀系列赛的帷幕拉开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a17f60b8d0747c958f48759cceb43e8cf50b7e20ad0d419e172fe2b731263ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        88,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/88/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:911f9e41407c4fe93e25e0ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "年幼的比萨",
      "source_fingerprint": "b56eeef25927bf772c6816bad05e20b3afd6ef3768168b7d99f2e738f9edd38c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d9d6767eb2e03671dd14c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想笑着，和她们一起奔跑。\n所以……我会继续跑下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb59e0bbe42d207f84e0b022907f959385299aad6b67e259e2c6eef31fc9bd05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
